<title>UK: SOCCER-NORTHERN IRELAND BEAT BELGIUM 3-0 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NORTHERN IRELAND BEAT BELGIUM 3-0 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>BELFAST 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Ireland beat Belgium 3-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in a friendly soccer international on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Jimmy Quinn 14, Jim Magilton 62 pen,</p>
<p>Philip Mulryne 88</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,126</p>
</text>
